<title>USA: U.S. approves NGC-Destec $1.3 billion merger.</title>
<headline>U.S. approves NGC-Destec $1.3 billion merger.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Federal Energy Regulatory Commission on Wednesday approved NGC Corp.'s proposed $1.3 billion acquisition of Destec Energy Inc.</p>
<p>With the FERC approval, company executives said they expected the deal to be completed by July.</p>
<p>The merger will add 1,800 megawatts to NGC's power generation from 20 power plants centred largely in California and Texas.</p>
</text>
